			"updated": 1772793626918,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "In a distributed system, if a Partition occurs (P) the system must choose\nbetween Availability (A) and Consistency (C).\n\nElse (E) when there is no partition, the system must choose between Latency\n(L) and Consistency (C).",
			"rawText": "In a distributed system, if a Partition occurs (P) the system must choose between Availability (A) and Consistency (C).\n\nElse (E) when there is no partition, the system must choose between Latency (L) and Consistency (C).",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "center",
			"verticalAlign": "middle",
			"containerId": "hnwS5hSa",
			"originalText": "In a distributed system, if a Partition occurs (P) the system must choose between Availability (A) and Consistency (C).\n\nElse (E) when there is no partition, the system must choose between Latency (L) and Consistency (C).",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"link": null
		},
